A cylindrical metal roller is $40$ cm long. Its radius is ground down at $0.05$ cm/min while the length stays fixed. At what rate is its volume changing when the radius is $12$ cm?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,1.2) -- (4.5,1.2);
\draw (0,-1.2) -- (4.5,-1.2);
\draw (4.5,0) ellipse (0.5 and 1.2);
\draw (0,1.2) arc (90:270:0.5 and 1.2);
\draw[dashed] (0,1.2) arc (90:-90:0.5 and 1.2);
\draw[-{Stealth}] (4.5,0) -- (4.5,1.2) node[midway, right] {$r$};
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (0,-1.8) -- (4.5,-1.8) node[midway, below] {$40$ cm};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

A conical filter stands on its vertex. It is $15$ cm deep with a top radius of $5$ cm. Liquid drains from the vertex at $3$ cm³/s. At what rate is the depth of liquid changing when the depth is $6$ cm?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=1.25]
\coordinate (V) at (0,0);
\coordinate (L) at (-1.2,3.6);
\coordinate (R) at (1.2,3.6);
\coordinate (T) at (0,3.6);
\coordinate (WC) at (0,1.44);
\coordinate (WL) at (-0.48,1.44);
\draw (L) -- (V);
\draw (V) -- (R);
\draw (L) arc (180:360:1.2 and 0.32);
\draw[dashed] (L) arc (180:0:1.2 and 0.32);
\draw (WL) arc (180:360:0.48 and 0.13);
\draw[dashed] (WL) arc (180:0:0.48 and 0.13);
\draw[dashed] (V) -- (WC) node[midway, left] {$h$};
\draw[dashed] (WC) -- (T);
\draw[-{Stealth}] (T) -- (R) node[midway, above] {$5$ cm};
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (1.9,0) -- (1.9,3.6) node[midway, right] {$15$ cm};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

A hot-air balloon rises vertically at $3$ m/s from a launch point $60$ m from an observer on level ground. At what rate is the balloon's distance from the observer increasing when the balloon is $80$ m high?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{calc}
\coordinate (A) at (0,0);
\coordinate (G) at (3,0);
\coordinate (Ba) at (3,4);
\draw (-0.5,0) -- (3.8,0);
\draw (A) -- (G) node[midway, below] {$60$ m};
\draw (G) -- (Ba) node[midway, right] {$y$};
\draw (A) -- (Ba) node[midway, above left] {$s$};
\coordinate (p) at ($(G)!0.35cm!(A)$);
\coordinate (q) at ($(G)!0.35cm!(Ba)$);
\draw (p) -- ($(p)+(q)-(G)$) -- (q);
\fill (A) circle (2pt);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

A lamp is mounted on top of a $5$ m post. A person $2$ m tall walks away from the post at $1.2$ m/s. At what rate is the length of the person's shadow increasing?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (B) at (0,0);
\coordinate (L) at (0,2.5);
\coordinate (P) at (3,0);
\coordinate (H) at (3,1);
\coordinate (S) at (5,0);
\draw (-0.5,0) -- (5.6,0);
\draw (B) -- (L) node[midway, left] {$5$ m};
\draw (P) -- (H) node[midway, left] {$2$ m};
\draw (L) -- (S);
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (0,-0.7) -- (3,-0.7) node[midway, below] {$x$};
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (3,-1.4) -- (5,-1.4) node[midway, below] {$s$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
